A new funeral claim has been captured, with claim no: {!VAR_IN_ClaimNumber} and Policy Number {!VAR_IN_PolicyNumber}

You can view the claim here: {!VAR_Path_ClaimRecord}</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
